# N4 slice 1, staged (LMX_semantics.ru.md #method-parts; Codex OPUS-CODEX-20261015-23 Q3: a void reference is a
# separate mechanism): the pointer p of S is a reference, so under call: S D it would assign the p place of D, and
# no reference place of the data is admitted yet. Refused at the declaration of p.
int: k 4
S:
    int: x 1
    @: p int @k
end: S
D:
    int: x 0
    @: p int @k
end: D
call: S D
return
